<title>SOUTH KOREA: SKorea Dainong shrs fall on Midopa news.</title>
<headline>SKorea Dainong shrs fall on Midopa news.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dainong Corp's shares went limit down in late Thursday trade on the news its important affiliate Midopa Department Store Co had become a target of hostile takeover bid, brokers said.</p>
<p>Dainong's shares fell 800 won to its limit of 10,100 in active trading.  </p>
<p>Shindongbang Corp told the Korea Stock Exchange it was considering launching a hostile bid for a controlling stake in Midopa.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
</text>
